# ==========================================
# Large Data & Datasets (Keeps things local)
# ==========================================
# Restricted/raw corpora (PAN 2012 XML, GT-HarmBench CSV) and other bulk data
# are ignored by extension so they are never committed by accident.
*.csv
*.json
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# Explicit exceptions: derived Tier 1/2 files and docs that ARE tracked.
# Add new intentionally-tracked files here, or `git add -f` will be needed
# and future commits may silently drop them.
!README.md
!pan12/README.md
!pan12/test/readme.md
!pan12/train/README.md
!gt_harmbench/README.md
!agentic_ncmec/pan_ncmec_trajectories.jsonl
!pan_annotated/adapted_trajectories.jsonl
!pan_annotated/pan_manifests_v2.jsonl
!pan_annotated/regenerated_trajectories.jsonl

# regenerated_trajectories_noisy.jsonl is deliberately excluded (not just
# left un-excepted): it was found to contain verbatim excerpts of real PAN
# 2012 messages (retrieval-swap noise injection sources directly from the
# restricted corpus) — see docs/data_audit.md. Untracked pending git-history
# purge and remote cleanup; do not re-add without regenerating it from a
# synthetic-only message bank first.
pan_annotated/regenerated_trajectories_noisy.jsonl

# ==========================================
# Python / Data Science Environment
# ==========================================
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ==========================================
# System / IDE Junk
# ==========================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/